lies between `0.9452` and `0.9453`, so `1 − E` is between `5.47 %` and `5.48 %` (the text's `5.48 %`),
against Schwarzschild's `1 − √(8/9)` between `5.71 %` and `5.72 %`. (`FRC.Strong.isco_efficiency`, `Theme/Strong.lean`). -/
